APPROVE — independent narrow-delta review of cand-2KZH2JA107QCVY6KMP7ZM3G4R4 at exact 7c7858f3c6aac5277bb34e905b532828d22da1a2.

The prior 337600b counterexample is closed. DiagnosticOriginSpec validates nonempty, trimmed, control-free root/reason before verification; the exact Origin.Diagnostic returned by VerifiedNfrdBaseball is derived from that same checked value. input-receipt/v3 binds the diagnostic tag, full root/reason, and origin checksum.

artifactReferenceSummary covers the two manifests, three fixed stimulus artifacts, and both verified references per participant. Its canonical rows bind typed kind, global or full ParticipantKey checksum, and checked relative path, sorted before hashing under the versioned artifact-reference domain. The complete receipt binds count plus digest. Rendering exposes only counts/checksums: no participant token, filename, relative path, root, or participant content.

Independent exact archive evidence:
- restored exact NfrdBaseballSuite 21/21 plus NfrdIntakePublicSuite 4/4;
- deleting origin canonical parts/checksum from the complete receipt failed the intended root/reason inequality court: 20/21;
- deleting reference count/checksum from the complete receipt failed the intended relocation inequality court: 20/21;
- deleting only paths from the artifact-reference digest failed both the independent digest oracle and relocation court: 19/21;
- restored intake.scala SHA-256 85c271e1195e8f419f8244a0940fbc9b4ac4765e8308f865f21ec3412ffe2017 exactly matches the immutable candidate blob.

The candidate evidence ledger separately records the exact full cross-platform gate, fresh 113-participant aggregate-only real-data court, Git ancestry, and Scala type-discipline pass. I inspected no participant text or raw participant files. APPROVE; chief authorization and merged-tree/full-court disposition remain separate.
